OL,3,GNEWSAA question of trust in the NHS    
OL,4,Acould be Swinney's most dangerous      
OL,5,Apolitical moment                       
OL,7,FAt its heart this is a story about     
OL,8,Ftrust.                                 
OL,10,FTrust in doctors and other health      
OL,11,Fprofessionals at NHS Grampian to       
OL,12,Fprovide the highest standards of       
OL,13,Ftreatment and care.                    
OL,15,FTrust in their managers to effectively 
OL,16,Fdeal with problems when they arise.    
OL,18,FAnd trust in the Scottish government to
OL,19,Fstep in if that does not happen.       
